Homepage: https://github.com/2E0LXY/Advanced-IP-Analyser
Description: Debian network inventory and remote access utility
 Advanced IP Analyser discovers reachable hosts, identifies TCP services,
 stores saved devices, exchanges inventories, opens remote services, provides
 Wake-on-LAN, confirmed SSH power actions, built-in packet analysis,
 long-running network monitoring, passive Wi-Fi observation, bounded web
 security auditing, detailed asset profiles, and verified updates.
